< ed bases. If the "Confine mutations to primer 5\u2032 tails" option is selected, the replacement seq
< uence will always be attached to the 5\u2032 end of the primers, regardless of the length of the sub
< stitution.',Ql=S(),xl=c("p"),xl.textContent=`There are two optional parameters that can be used to i
