> e kit utilizes the robust Q5 Hot Start High-Fidelity DNA Polymerase along with custom mutagenic prim
> ers to create insertions, deletions, and substitutions in a wide variety of plasmids. NEBaseChanger 
> will design the custom mutagenic primers for use in the Q5 Site-Directed Mutagenesis Kit. Primers de
> signed for this kit can accommodate more complex mutagenic strategies than other commercial SDM kits
>  including multiple substitutions within a 100 nucleotide region or insertions up to 100 nucleotides
